[{"id":"11d42786","elType":"section","settings":{"structure":"22","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"72","right":"0","bottom":"124","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"36","right":"0","bottom":"36","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"d721a1c","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":66,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"4abf46a0","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Esther Ouwehand en haar partner: een teruggetrokken liefdesleven","header_size":"h1"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"1756f008","elType":"widget","settings":{"icon_list":[{"selected_icon":{"value":{"id":907,"url":"https://slaapkamerinspiratie.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/mdi_calendar-today.svg"},"library":"svg"},"_id":"9a0fae1","custom_date_format":"F j, Y","custom_time_format":"g:i a","custom_text":"Publicatie: 22 november 2023","show_icon":"custom","link":""}],"space_between":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]},"icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":24,"sizes":[]},"_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"16","right":"0","bottom":"36","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=primary","icon_typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=text"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"post-info"},{"id":"33ac323c","elType":"widget","settings":{"source":"custom","author_avatar":{"id":912,"url":"https://slaapkamerinspiratie.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/undefined-2024-10-31T090156.319.jpeg","alt":"undefined - 2024-10-31T090156.319","source":"library","size":""},"author_name":"Michael","author_name_tag":"span","author_bio":"Ik ben Michael, een schrijver die graag artikelen schrijft over onderwerpen die mensen boeien en informeren. Het plezier in schrijven ontdekte ik al vroeg, en sindsdien is het mijn passie geworden om complexe onderwerpen op een begrijpelijke en aantrekkelijke manier uit te leggen. In mijn werk probeer ik altijd een balans te vinden tussen nuttige informatie en een vlotte, toegankelijke stijl. Ik schrijf over uiteenlopende thema’s, van actualiteit tot lifestyle, en geniet van het proces om van elk artikel iets waardevols te maken. Mijn doel is om lezers iets mee te geven waar ze echt iets aan hebben.






","link_text":"All Posts","image_vertical_align":"middle","image_size":{"unit":"px","size":100,"sizes":[]},"image_border_radius":{"unit":"px","size":100,"sizes":[]},"name_color":"#000000","name_typography_typography":"custom","name_typography_font_family":"Inter","name_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"name_typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"name_typography_font_weight":"700","bio_typography_typography":"custom","bio_typography_font_family":"Inter","bio_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":11,"sizes":[]},"bio_typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":14,"sizes":[]},"bio_typography_font_weight":"400","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_margin_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"36","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"name_color":"globals/colors?id=primary","name_typography_typography":""}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"author-box"},{"id":"167c3563","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Esther Ouwehand, prominent lid en gezicht van de Partij voor de Dieren, zet zich actief in voor dierenwelzijn en een duurzame samenleving. Ondanks haar zichtbaarheid in de politiek, houdt ze haar privéleven grotendeels afgeschermd. Toch is er enige informatie over haar partner beschikbaar, en blijft de vraag hoe ze haar persoonlijke leven in balans houdt met haar publieke verantwoordelijkheden.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"3ab77de","elType":"widget","settings":{"html":"<blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/p/DE4GFumtrto/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" data-instgrm-version="14" style=" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);"><div 